    "ScenarioDef": {
      "BTG_ExiledTraders.description": {
        "english": "A routine salvage job at an orbital relay gone wrong. A hidden mechanoid beacon, and your crew woke the mechhive. The Traders Guild wasted no time distancing themselves from the fallout, revoking your membership before the signal even finished broadcasting. With no allies, low supplies and the swarm closing in, you have nowhere left to go but down.\n\nNote: This is a difficult scenario and is not recommended for new players.",
